      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners express sincere gratitude toward Dr. V and clinic staff for compassionate, affordable treatments that stabilize ailing pets. However, a significant subset of reviewers reports feeling dismissed during consultations, citing patronizing communication, poor listening, and abrasive front-office encounters."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Careful treatment alongside restraint disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently credit clinicians with nursing sick pets back to health through thorough diagnostics and surgery. Conversely, several dissatisfied pet parents raise concerns regarding bedside manner, describing situations where muzzles were used abruptly on gentle animals or pets appeared stressed by handling."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Extensive outdoor queues and walk-in delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Because the hospital operates without formal appointments, pet owners frequently experience grueling wait times lasting two to three hours outside the facility. Reviewers express strong frustration over standing outdoors in rain or summer heat while waiting for their turn to be called inside."
      }
    }
  ],
